Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Marblehead has one of those\Ncrisp,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.07,0:00:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,bright October beach mornings\Ntoday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,For Saturday October 10th,\NRiverhead Beach
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.61,0:00:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,looks especially lovely from\N10:30 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,to 1:00 PM,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.47,0:00:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,with sunny skies, around 56\Ndegrees,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.45,0:00:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and wind at 9 mph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.33,0:00:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a nice high-tide paddle\Nboard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,window, with high tide at\N11:41
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.47,0:00:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,AM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Low tides are 5:24 AM and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.41,0:00:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,5:52 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A light layer, a board, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.73,0:00:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,a little salt air that’s the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,day.
